--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,580] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 10 | Text: 富贵险中求也在险中丢
Segment #2   [00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:05,180] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 10 | Text: 求时失之一丢时失之九
Segment #3   [00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,980] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是你在求的时候是十分之一
Segment #4   [00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,860] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 9  | Text: 当你在丢的时候是十分之九
Segment #5   [00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,340] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 16 | Text: 我经常给直播间所有的在座的好朋友们分享
Segment #6   [00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,380] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 10 | Text: 我也有话叫做生来一无所有
Segment #7   [00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,640] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 何从怕我失去
Segment #8   [00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,200] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 8  | Text: 背后反映的是什么意思呢
Segment #9   [00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,920] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 是富贵险中求
Segment #10  [00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,700] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果说你是在零到一的阶段
Segment #11  [00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,420] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 你一定要富贵险中求
Segment #12  [00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:21,800] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #13  [00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,680] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为人无横才不富
Segment #14  [00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,100] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 马无叶草不飞
Segment #15  [00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,380] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是如果说你现在
Segment #16  [00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,180] | Elapsed:  13.93s | Words: 6  | Text: 为什么过去的皇帝
Segment #17  [00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:30,680] | Elapsed:  30.65s | Words: 12 | Text: 大明王朝在四百二十七年的时候
Segment #18  [00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,680] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 就已经送掉了
Segment #19  [00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,140] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为他只懂得打江山
Segment #20  [00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,300] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 他不会守江山
Segment #21  [00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,180] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 真正当你一到十的阶段
Segment #22  [00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,740] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 你就不能再想富贵险中求了
Segment #23  [00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,960] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 比如说你现在
Segment #24  [00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,100] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 11 | Text: 都得从五万块钱到了五十万
Segment #25  [00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,620] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 你现在最该做的事情是什么
Segment #26  [00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,840] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 14 | Text: 不是让这五十万到五百万到五千万
Segment #27  [00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,680] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 最重要的是不要让自己穷回去了
Segment #28  [00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,440] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 比如说我问你们一个问题
Segment #29  [00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:52,200] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 11 | Text: 现在有一万把手枪放在你的面前
Segment #30  [00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,100] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 开一枪给你多少钱你会开
Segment #31  [00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,720] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 开一枪给你多少钱你会开
Segment #32  [00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,040] | Elapsed:  30.66s | Words: 11 | Text: 一万分之一的几率你就挂了
Segment #33  [00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,520] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 10 | Text: 我告诉你正确的答案是什么
Segment #34  [00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:02,120] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果说你是在一到十的阶段
Segment #35  [00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:04,520] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 12 | Text: 无论给多少钱你都不能开这一枪
Segment #36  [00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:06,700] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 11 | Text: 因为哪怕有万分之一的可能性
Segment #37  [00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:07,820] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 这一下就翻评了
Segment #38  [00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:08,960] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 人不能翻评
Segment #39  [00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,240] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以说我想给你们表达
Segment #40  [00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,460] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 竟然往上中心思想
Segment #41  [00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,780] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 5  | Text: 富贵险中求
Segment #42  [00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:14,540] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 你们知不知道下一句话叫什么
Segment #43  [00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:15,620] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 很多人真的不知道
Segment #44  [00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:16,920] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 8  | Text: 两万 两万块钱你开
Segment #45  [00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:19,360] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 分阶段零到一的阶段
Segment #46  [00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,220] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 两千块钱我都开
Segment #47  [00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,860] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是我跟你讲的是一到十
Segment #48  [00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:23,260] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 你可能你越多理解有问题
Segment #49  [00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:24,760] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 在一到十的阶段
Segment #50  [00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,040] | Elapsed:  48.41s | Words: 5  | Text: 多少钱都不能开
